dialect protocol
protocol remodel.spr
version 1
schema remodel.scene.mutation
start record
framing record
record remodel.remodel-add-vertex tag=1
field format u8
field ordinal varint
field body bytes
record remodel.remodel-set-face tag=2
field format u8
field ordinal varint
field body bytes
record remodel.remodel-transform-mesh tag=3
field format u8
field ordinal varint
field body bytes
chain hash u64
